{% comment %}
================================================================================
  KWEFI TEMPLATE  ·  Light theme  ·  Single-product PDP

  HOW TO USE
  1. Replace every [BRACKETED] placeholder with your product copy.
  2. Swap image URLs (src="...") with your CDN assets.
  3. Tune brand colors via the CSS variables in the :root block at the top.
  4. Add / remove feature cards, FAQ items, studies cards as needed.
  5. Drop into Shopify as a section (search for "Kwefi Template").

  STRUCTURE
  · Hero (gallery + info + 2 offer cards + bonus gifts + CTA + 90-day guarantee + UGC)
  · Trust marquee
  · Featured cards grid (4 product highlights)
  · Detail image slider (specs / parts / ingredients)
  · Comparison table
  · Studies / "Inside The Box" expandable cards
  · Guarantee section
  · FAQ
  · Footer
  · Gift explainer modal · Sticky CTA

================================================================================
{% endcomment %}
{% raw %}
